fter all buttons are ACTIVATED to WIN ⭐ \n\nJoin the Communications Server for any NEW Updates! 💬\nPlease LIKE and FAVORITE the Game! 👍\n\nDEVELOPMENT TEAM:\n- @monkeyboy4476 (Project Lead)\n- @RT_Adam55 (Scripter)\n- @610super (Modeler, Builder, Music Composer, GFX Artist, VFX Artist)\n- @zomb1eghe (UI Designer)\n\nInspired By: Flee The Facility, Forsaken, Untitled Tag Game, Evade","path":"/game/133281939656436-diokophobia","slug":"133281939656436-diokophobia","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/c69529c948a18d0a90af9699b623d47573ac2bdb6914eae49015a66f9f69452b.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-d942f713b3a570d745333a1c297a008d/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":1,"visitor":10346235,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-06-13T03:18:36.584Z","creator":{"name":"OHWORD","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":136003210253823,"name":"Stop the Train Simulator","desc":"🚆 STOP THE TRAIN – Can you become strong enough to stop a speeding train? 💪🔥\n\n🏋️‍♂️ Train your muscles on powerful workout machines!\n💪 Build insane strength and bulk like never before!\n🚂 Step onto the tracks and try to stop the unstoppable!\n🌍 Unlock new zones by stopping faster and bigger trains!\n\n🐾 Collect pets to boost your strength gains!\n\n🔥 NEW UPDATES EVERY WEEK! 🔥\n\n✨ Premium players get a +10% strength bonus! 🏆\n\nLast Update: Offline earnings - Season Pass - Rainbow & Shiny Trains - Special Events\n\n🎁 Join our group for a FREE OP PET! 💥\n🔗 https://www.roblox.com/communities/32732262/RIVRS-Games#!/","path":"/game/136003210253823-stop-the-train-simulator","slug":"136003210253823-stop-the-train-simulator","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a3c7f19618eb5f74087c3ec139fe1a54f82d9bfbdb5a03482b65ca6af0bd9833.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-fa14468af8cedd694f4434ad207a002b/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":1,"visitor":11367893,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-12-05T07:36:04.495Z","creator":{"name":"Rivrs x Sim","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":113829431520841,"name":"💖Slayerbound💖","desc":"🔥 SLAYERBOUND – Demon Slayer Anime RPG on Roblox ⚔️\n\nSlayerbound is an anime RPG inspired by Demon Slayer (Kimetsu no Yaiba) on Roblox. Become a powerful Demon Slayer, master breathing techniques, and fight dangerous demons in an immersive RPG experience.\n\n⚔️ Become a Demon Slayer\nTrain your character\nUnlock Breathing Styles\nUse swords and special anime abilities\n\nKEYBINDS \nM1 - Attack\nM2 - Heavy Attack\nF - Block\nW+W - Run\nM - Menu\nG - Breathing\nC - Impulse\nJ - Crow\n1-9 - Skills\n\n\n📈 Full RPG Progression\nLevel up your character\nUpgrade stats\nUnlock new skills\nGrow stronger with every battle\n\n🌍 Anime World Inspired by Demon Slayer\nDetailed maps\nDark fantasy atmosphere\nDesigned for anime and RPG fans\n\n","path":"/game/113829431520841-slayerbound","slug":"113829431520841-slayerbound","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/25c8fc567582d0a72242ffe5e4d7b5a7487b0bb6eca99fe97dc043caf2da872d.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-9f178c50aa3248c6e6b5b89b682fa789/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":1,"visitor":3376740,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-02-09T02:07:45.404Z","creator":{"name":"MiraiInc.","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":138567178385911,"name":"Escape Tsunami For Cats","desc":"Welcome to Escape Tsunami for Cats! 🐻\n\nRun fast and steal Cats! 🏃\nAvoid tsunamis when they come! 🌊\nStay alive and collect many Cats! ⚡\nBoost your speed or carry limit with items from the Gear Shop! ⚙️\nUpgrade your character and get more cash! 💸\nUpgrade your plot to unlock more slots and place extra characters! 🏗️\nTrade or gift your characters with friends and grow together! 🎁\n\nYour Cats earn cash OFFLINE! 💤\n\nLike the game and join the group for more! 👍","path":"/game/138567178385911-escape-tsunami-for-cats","slug":"138567178385911-